	<string id="pda_ref_mon_tushkano">
		<text>Tushkano</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_tushkano_text">
		<text>A small mutant rodent. Nearly harmless alone, but a pack swarms its prey and wears it down fast.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_flesh">
		<text>Flesh</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_flesh_text">
		<text>A mutated pig. Slow and clumsy, but it can knock you down and trample you.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_dog">
		<text>Blind dog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_dog_text">
		<text>Lost its sight but tracks prey by smell and sound. Hunts in packs and surrounds its target.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_boar">
		<text>Boar</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_boar_text">
		<text>A large, tough mutant. Charges at its prey and takes a lot of hits.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_pseudodog">
		<text>Pseudodog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_pseudodog_text">
		<text>A strong and fast predator that often leads a pack of blind dogs.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_psy_dog">
		<text>Psy-dog</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_psy_dog_text">
		<text>Creates phantom copies of itself. Kill the real one and the copies vanish.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_snork">
		<text>Snork</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_snork_text">
		<text>A former human in a torn gas mask. Moves on all fours and leaps from far away.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_bloodsucker">
		<text>Bloodsucker</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_bloodsucker_text">
		<text>Can turn almost invisible. Gives itself away by heavy breathing and footsteps.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_poltergeist">
		<text>Poltergeist</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_poltergeist_text">
		<text>An invisible anomalous entity. Throws objects; the fire variety attacks with flames.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_controller">
		<text>Controller</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_controller_text">
		<text>A mutant with a powerful psy attack. Breaks the will and strikes the mind from a distance.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_burer">
		<text>Burer</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_burer_text">
		<text>A telekinetic: tears weapons from hands, throws grenades back and hides behind a force shield.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_chimera">
		<text>Chimera</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_chimera_text">
		<text>One of the deadliest predators in the Zone. Leaps over huge distances and inflicts heavy wounds.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_gigant">
		<text>Pseudogiant</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_mon_gigant_text">
		<text>A huge mutant. Its ground slam knocks down everyone nearby.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_zone_intro">
		<text>The Zone</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_zone_intro_text">
		<text>The area around the Chernobyl NPP, changed after the second blast in 2006. Anomalies, mutants and emissions make every step dangerous, and artefacts make it worth the risk.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_emission">
		<text>Emission</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_emission_text">
		<text>A powerful energy burst from the center of the Zone. Before it the sky turns red and a hum grows. Hide in buildings or underground: in the open an emission kills everything alive and moves the anomalies.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_anomalies">
		<text>Anomalies</text>
	</string>
	<string id="pda_ref_art_anomalies_text">
		<text>Patches of space where physics works differently. Look for distorted air, electric sparks or clouds of steam. A detector and a thrown bolt help find a safe path. Artefacts are born around anomalies.</text>
	</string>
